622:| source-dupes | gate | `node scripts/source-dupes.mjs [--registry <path>] [--sources <path>]` → `SOURCE_DUPES: CLEAN` exit 0 / `DRIFT` exit 1 / `FAIL-CLOSED` exit 2 / usage 64, contract `kumitate-source-dupes-v1`; default `.ufo/pins/source-dupes.json` pins the set of live duplicate-URL groups (same normalized URL under differing scopes — the census W04 class); a NEW duplicate group is DRIFT `new-duplicate`, a pinned group that no longer duplicates is DRIFT `stale-known`, and a pin whose member/url shape mismatches the live group is DRIFT `known-mismatch`; malformed registry, a row id covered by two pins, or an unreadable sources doc is FAIL-CLOSED | `--selftest` (12 hermetic cases; `SOURCE_DUPES_SELFTEST: PASS (12/12)` + `VERDICT: PASS`) | `.ufo/pins/source-dupes.json`; `corpus/SOURCES.md`; `pin.source-dupes` in `kumitate-gate-pins-v1` |
